    "content": "# License\n\nGROBID uses different licenses for software, documentation, and annotated data.\n\n## Software\n\nThe GROBID software is distributed under the Apache License 2.0.\n\n- Full license text: see the repository root `LICENSE` file on GitHub.\n- Canonical license URL: [https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)\n\n## Documentation\n\nThe documentation is distributed under the CC0 1.0 Universal license.\n\n- License: [https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/](https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/)\n\n## Annotated data\n\nAnnotated data is distributed under the CC BY 4.0 license.\n\n- License: [https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)\n\n## Contributions\n\nIf you contribute to GROBID, your contribution is shared under the same licensing model used by the project.\n\n## Contacts\n\n- Patrice Lopez: `<patrice.lopez@science-miner.com>`\n- Luca Foppiano: `<luca@sciencialab.com>`"
